# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/Linux 交叉导致
# 脚本无法执行、jsonl 指纹不一致（本项目已踩过一次）
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.csv  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf

*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.pt binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
